{"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["# Document IR and technical classifier\n","This first pilot works on text already extracted by the repository parser. It does not claim table/layout fidelity."]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{},"outputs":[],"source":["import json,sys\n","from pathlib import Path\n","sys.path.insert(0,str(Path.cwd()))\n","from astro_technical_extraction.document_ir import DocumentIR\n","from astro_technical_extraction.classifier import RuleBasedClassifier\n","from astro_technical_extraction.coverage import build_coverage_report\n","fixture='''Calculate the Ascendant from local sidereal time.\\nThe author was born in the sixteenth century.\\nThe soul participates in the divine order of the cosmos.\\nIn this example chart Mars signifies the tenth house.\\nA planet in domicile has essential dignity.'''\n","doc=DocumentIR.from_text('FIXTURE','synthetic.txt',fixture)\n","clf=RuleBasedClassifier()\n","results=clf.classify_many(doc.blocks)\n","for result in results: print(json.dumps(result.to_dict(),ensure_ascii=False))\n","print(json.dumps(build_coverage_report(doc,results),ensure_ascii=False,indent=2))"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["## Real source integration\n","Use the existing Book-to-Skill parser and pass its returned text to DocumentIR.from_text. When richer page/block records are available use blocks_from_records to preserve locators."]}],"metadata":{"kernelspec":{"display_name":"Python 3","language":"python","name":"python3"},"nbformat":4,"nbformat_minor":5}
